        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6.01 The Employer shall post a work schedule for all employees covered by this Agreement no later than 3:00 P.M. each Saturday for the following week. If an employee is off on Saturday, then this employee's schedule shall be posted no later than 3:00 P.M. on Friday. Changes may be made in this schedule in emergency only, and with verification by the Union.",
