        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.01 The Employer agrees to display the U.F.C.W. International Union Store Card, gratis, for the period of this Agreement. Said Union Store Card shall remain the property of the Union, and the Employer does hereby agree that the breach or violation of any of the provisions of this Agreement on its part shall constitute sufficient cause for the removal of the said Union Store Card by the Union.",
